'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[heavy armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
The set was obtained by pre-ordering Helldivers 2. It has not been made available since.<ref>Discord conversation with AH Support regarding exclusive item eligibility brackets | [https://discord.com/channels/1210060956584124416/1210073264928456764/1496914142777311253 Discord link] | [[:File:Primary_Source_Discord_conversation_with_BVits_regarding_exclusive_item_eligibility_brackets.png|File]]</ref>

== Passive Ability ==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Servo-Assisted}}

== Trivia ==
*Visually, the armor set is an [[FS-23 Battle Master]] reskin, but it differs with two equally tight shoulder pads replacing the raised left one—along with a more menacing color scheme in place of the standard yellow accents.

